I get result Shop1 and Shop2.
In shop 1 red and sweet is apple. in shop 2 red is book, sweet is pumpkin.
BUT I want get only Shop1 with apple, where all params is in one product.
Something like this:

string Query=products[*].params[*] ANY (LIKE('red') AND LIKE('sweet'));	

